{
  "rule": "OBI-D-10",
  "section": "10.2",
  "description": "Has every operation input and output and every entry in schemas valid against the JSON Schema 2020-12 meta-schemas, which validate its subschemas in turn, with format as an annotation, JSON Schema's default (JSON Schema Validation §7.2.1), and the meta-schemas' pattern values read as ECMA-262 regular expressions, the dialect JSON Schema names (JSON Schema Core §6.4). Note: the pinned meta-schemas make the rule decidable offline; it resolves none of the document's references and evaluates no value against the document's schemas.",
  "notes": "Schema positions are operation input, operation output, and entries in the top-level schemas map; the meta-schemas validate subschemas recursively. 0.2.0 admits boolean schemas at every schema position (true accepts every value, false accepts none, {} is equivalent to true), so the positive cases exercise boolean form at top-level and nested positions alongside object form. The rule is meta-schema validity only: an unparseable pattern, an unresolvable reference, and in-place recursion pass, because whether a schema can be evaluated is JSON Schema's and surfaces when a tool uses it. Negative cases list OBI-D-10 alone even where the derived document schema would also reject the value structurally, per this corpus's OBI-D-02 suppression convention.",
  "tests": [
    {
      "description": "object schemas with nested subschemas at operation input and output are valid schemas",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "title": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "tags": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "title"
              ]
            },
            "output": {
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "boolean schema true at operation input is a valid schema (contract specified, every value satisfies it)",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "ping": {
            "input": true
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "boolean schema false at operation output is a valid schema (contract specified, no value satisfies it)",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "fireAndForget": {
            "output": false
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "empty object schema {} at operation input is a valid schema (the equivalent spelling of true)",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "ping": {
            "input": {}
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "boolean schema as an entry in the top-level schemas map is a valid schema",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "Anything": true
        },
        "operations": {
          "echo": {
            "input": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Anything"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "boolean schemas at nested subschema positions (properties value, additionalProperties, items) are valid schemas",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "configure": {
            "input": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "locked": false,
                "values": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": true
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "unknown keywords are legitimate annotations, not meta-schema violations",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "type": "object",
              "x-internal": true,
              "futureKeyword": {
                "arbitrary": "annotation"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "an unparseable pattern passes the meta-schemas: whether an engine compiles it is JSON Schema's, surfacing when a tool uses the schema",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "code": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "([unclosed"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "an unresolvable external $ref passes: meta-schema validity does not require resolving external resources",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "$ref": "https://schemas.example.com/never-published/task.json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "type keyword with a number value at operation input makes an invalid schema: the pinned meta-schemas reject it",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "type": 42
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "type keyword naming an unknown simple type fails the meta-schemas",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "type": "str"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "a string at operation output is neither object nor boolean form",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "output": "not-a-schema"
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "a number as an entry in the top-level schemas map is neither object nor boolean form",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "Task": 42
        },
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {}
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "a keyword value of the wrong JSON type at a nested subschema position (minLength as a string) fails recursively",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "Task": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": "3"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "operations": {
          "createTask": {
            "input": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Task"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "required as a string instead of an array inside an items subschema at operation input",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "createTasks": {
            "input": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": "title"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "oneOf as an object instead of an array at operation output",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "getTask": {
            "output": {
              "oneOf": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "a number as a subschema inside an anyOf array is neither object nor boolean form",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "getTask": {
            "output": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                42
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "a schema that applies itself in place passes the meta-schemas: JSON Schema leaves such recursion undefined at evaluation (section 9.4.1), not a document rule",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "A": {
            "$ref": "#/schemas/A"
          }
        },
        "operations": {
          "f": {
            "input": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/A"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "recursion that moves to another instance location, through properties and items, is a valid schema",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "Tree": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "children": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/schemas/Tree"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "operations": {
          "f": {
            "input": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/Tree"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "a meta-schema pattern is an ECMA-262 regular expression, so an $anchor ending in a newline fails the anchor pattern",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "a": {
            "input": {
              "$anchor": "a\n"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false
    },
    {
      "description": "count keywords take a non-negative integer, judged by exact value (section 10), so minLength 1.0 and maxProperties 0 are valid",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "operations": {
          "op": {
            "input": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1.0
            },
            "output": {
              "type": "object",
              "maxProperties": 0
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": true
    },
    {
      "description": "an object at a schema position is a schema whether or not the meta-schemas accept it, so a pointer to one satisfies OBI-D-12 while OBI-D-10 reports the schema (section 7)",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "A": {
            "type": 42
          }
        },
        "operations": {
          "op": {
            "input": {
              "$ref": "#/schemas/A"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ],
      "notViolated": [
        "OBI-D-12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "an $anchor value outside the JSON Schema Core section 8.2.2 grammar declares no plain name, so two of them declare nothing twice and OBI-D-13 holds (section 7.3)",
      "document": {
        "openbindings": "0.2.0",
        "schemas": {
          "A": {
            "$anchor": "bad/name"
          },
          "B": {
            "$anchor": "bad/name"
          }
        },
        "operations": {}
      },
      "valid": false,
      "violates": [
        "OBI-D-10"
      ],
      "notViolated": [
        "OBI-D-13"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
